#: app/templates/about.html:337
msgid "How we source news for debate"
msgstr "Hoe we nieuws voor debat sourapen"

#: app/templates/about.html:343
msgid "Built in the open"
msgstr "Gebouwd in het openbaar"

#: app/templates/about.html:344
msgid ""
"Society Speaks is open source (AGPL). Audit the code, contribute "
"improvements, or self-host components for your own civic stack."
msgstr ""
"Society Speaks is open source (AGPL). Controleer de code, draag "
"verbeteringen bij of host componenten zelf voor je eigen burgersysteem."

#: app/templates/about.html:345
msgid ""
"The code and the data are licensed separately: individual votes and "
"responses are never sold and never licensed to anyone. Only aggregate, "
"anonymised patterns — what society agrees on, where it divides, how "
"judgement shifts over time — may be licensed to institutions, and that "
"revenue keeps the platform free and ad-free."
msgstr ""
"De code en de data hebben aparte licenties: individuele stemmen en reacties "
"worden nooit verkocht en nooit aan iemand in licentie gegeven. Alleen "
"geaggregeerde, geanonimiseerde patronen — waar de samenleving het over eens "
"is, waar ze verdeeld is, hoe oordelen in de loop van de tijd verschuiven — "
"mogen in licentie worden gegeven aan instellingen, en die inkomsten houden "
"het platform gratis en vrij van advertenties."

#: app/templates/about.html:347
msgid "View Society Speaks source code on GitHub (opens in new tab)"
msgstr "Bekijk Society Speaks broncode op GitHub (opent in nieuw tabblad)"

